 l'amour avec un grand A, venez vous d\u00e9hancher sur les meilleurs morceaux de la belle \u00e9poque mais aussi d'aujourd'hui.\n\nSitu\u00e9 sur la chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo \u00e0 Uccle et \u00e0 deux pas du bout de l'avenue Louise et du Bois de la Cambre, visitez ce temple de l'ambiance. Le BARABAR se pose en tant que r\u00e9f\u00e9rence des rythmes branch\u00e9s bien connus!\n\nJust Be Ready et que la f\u00eate continue !\nL'\u00e9quipe des Belges Jeunesses & le BARABAR\n\nDRESS Code : Urban Chic\nDoors open : 22h00\n\nLa direction se r\u00e9serve le droit d'entr\u00e9e.\n\nBARABAR\n862, Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo \u00e0 1180 R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale","performers":"Barabar","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/847341234183085","email":"gabriel@lesbelgesjeunesses.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 28 74 54","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002705"},"sp":{"name":"\u2606CATCH ME I'M SINGLE : Barabar x Les Belges Jeunesses\u2606 [ENTREE GRATUITE]","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/847341234183085","email":"gabriel@lesbelgesjeunesses.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 28 74 54","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002705"},"nl":{"name":"\u2606CATCH ME I'M SINGLE : Barabar x Les Belges Jeunesses\u2606 [ENTREE GRATUITE]","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/847341234183085","email":"gabriel@lesbelgesjeunesses.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 28 74 54","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002705"}},"place":{"id":274443,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Barabar","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"862","address_street_box":"1180","email":null,"website":