00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":309732,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"other","ranking":0.3218297948685433,"languages":{"spoken":["nl","fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibitions","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Just Landed","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/fr\/just-landed-showcase-2\/","email":"info@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002600"},"pt":{"name":"Just Landed","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/fr\/just-landed-showcase-2\/","email":"info@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002600"},"en":{"name":"Just Landed","shortdescr":"Early autumn of 2024, a new community of artists, designers and makers landed at the dynamic hub of USquare in Ixelles. This marks an exciting new chapter within our innovative community. This collaborative environment brings together artists, makers, designers and academic researchers.\u2063","longdescr":"The Just Landed exhibition marks the start of a new phase of temporary occupation at Usquare, bringing together a community of artists, designers, scientists and makers. For this exhibition, a selection of residents has been chosen by Ohme, either for their practices in the digital arts or for their hybridisations between art and science. Just Landed offers a glimpse of current creative practices, while hinting at future collaborations within this community.\n\nThrough a variety of works, Just Landed explores the interactions between matter, technology and perception. The works on show are at the crossroads of digital art, visual art and design, revealing a wide range of experimental approaches. Some explore the properties of raw materials, whether natural or recycled, highlighting chemical and physical processes that reveal dynamics that are often invisible. Other creations immerse viewers in interactive environments, where sound, light and space are in dialogue.\n\nTraditional craft techniques are also reinterpreted through the prism of contemporary technologies, transforming age-old skills into installations that oscillate between the tangible and the digital imagination. This reappropriation of craft practices highlights the impact of technological advances on the way we perceive and interact with the world.\n\nJust Landed illustrates the convergence of various artistic and scientific approaches at Usquare, revealing how certain contemporary innovations open up new perspectives for artistic exploration. Beyond the exhibition, Just Landed captures a pivotal moment, hinting at future collaborations that will take this creative community in new directions.\n","performers":"Aiko Design, Nicolas Andry, Clarice Calvo-Pinsolle, Miguel Cipriano, Crafteke & Earthstone, Amandine David, Meriem Steiner, Ma\u00fftu, Meriem Steiner, Studio Lemercier, Studio Minim\u00e8tre, Nadja Meier, Yami Moreno & David Ferreira, Ohme & Frederik Vanhoutte, Damien Petitot, PYL, Guillaume Thunis\u2063","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/just-landed-showcase\/","email":"info@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002600"},"it":{"name":"Just Landed","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/fr\/just-landed-showcase-2\/","email":"info@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002600"},"cn":{"name":"Just Landed","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/fr\/just-landed-showcase-2\/","email":"info@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002600"},"fr":{"name":"Just Landed","shortdescr":"Au d\u00e9but de l\u2019automne 2024, une nouvelle communaut\u00e9 d\u2019artistes, de designers et de cr\u00e9ateurs s\u2019est install\u00e9e dans le dynamique hub de USquare \u00e0 Ixelles. Cela marque un nouveau chapitre passionnant pour notre communaut\u00e9 innovante, qui r\u00e9unit artistes, cr\u00e9ateurs, designers et chercheurs acad\u00e9miques.\u2063","longdescr":"L\u2019exposition Just Landed marque le d\u00e9but d\u2019une nouvelle phase d\u2019occupation temporaire \u00e0 Usquare, r\u00e9unissant une communaut\u00e9 d\u2019artistes, de designers, de scientifiques et de technicien\u00b7nes. Pour cette exposition, un \u00e9chantillon de r\u00e9sident\u00b7es a \u00e9t\u00e9 s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 par Ohme, soit pour leurs pratiques dans les arts num\u00e9riques, soit pour leurs hybridations entre art et science. Just Landed offre un aper\u00e7u de pratiques cr\u00e9atives actuelles, tout en laissant entrevoir de futures collaborations au sein de cette communaut\u00e9.\n\n\u00c0 travers une pluralit\u00e9 d\u2019\u0153uvres, Just Landed explore des interactions entre mati\u00e8re, technologie et perception. Les \u0153uvres expos\u00e9es se situent \u00e0 la crois\u00e9e des arts num\u00e9riques, des arts plastiques et du design, d\u00e9voilant un large \u00e9ventail d\u2019approches exp\u00e9rimentales. Certaines explorent les propri\u00e9t\u00e9s des mat\u00e9riaux bruts, qu\u2019ils soient naturels ou recycl\u00e9s, mettant en lumi\u00e8re des processus chimiques et physiques qui r\u00e9v\u00e8lent des dynamiques souvent invisibles. D\u2019autres cr\u00e9ations immergent les spectateur\u00b7rices dans des environnements interactifs, o\u00f9 le son, la lumi\u00e8re et l\u2019espace sont en dialogue.\n\nLes techniques artisanales traditionnelles sont \u00e9galement r\u00e9interpr\u00e9t\u00e9es \u00e0 travers le prisme de technologies contemporaines, transformant des savoir-faire ancestraux en installations oscillant entre le tangible et l\u2019imaginaire num\u00e9rique. Cette r\u00e9appropriation des pratiques artisanales met en lumi\u00e8re l\u2019impact des avanc\u00e9es technologiques sur notre mani\u00e8re de percevoir et d\u2019interagir avec le monde.\n\nJust Landed illustre la convergence de diverses approches artistiques et scientifiques \u00e0 Usquare, en r\u00e9v\u00e9lant comment certaines innovations contemporaines ouvrent de nouvelles perspectives pour l\u2019exploration en art. Au-del\u00e0 de l'exposition, Just Landed capture un moment charni\u00e8re, laissant entrevoir les collaborations futures qui feront \u00e9voluer cette communaut\u00e9 cr\u00e9ative vers de nouvelles directions.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/fr\/just-landed-showcase-2\/","email":"info@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002600"},"sp":{"name":"Just Landed","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ohme.be\/fr\/just-landed-showcase-2\/","email":"info@ohme.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002600"},"nl":{"name":"Just Landed","shortdescr":"In het vroege najaar van 2024 streek een nieuwe gemeenschap van kunstenaars, ontwerpers en makers neer in de dynamische hub van USquare in Elsene. Dit luidt een spannend nieuw hoofdstuk in voor onze innovatieve gemeenschap, waar kunstenaars, makers, ontwerpers en academische onderzoekers same