iption_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Hilton Brussels Grand Place","address_street_name":"Carrefour de l'Europe ","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"brusselsgrandplace_events@hilton.com","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselsgrandplace.hilton.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 42 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 42 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Carrefour de l'Europe , 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"D\u00e9couvrez le luxe moderne au Hilton Brussels Grand Place, id\u00e9alement situ\u00e9 entre la Grand Place et le Square Meeting and Convention Center. Nos 236 chambres et suites offrent une d\u00e9tente confortable, tandis que Sentro, notre restaurant sur place, propose une cuisine cr\u00e9ative aux saveurs belges. Profitez de notre centre de fitness, de notre Executive Lounge et d'une exposition d'art gratuite pr\u00e9sentant l'artiste belge Fran\u00e7ois Coorens en 2024. Explorez la culture, le shopping et les sites historiques de Bruxelles \u00e0 quelques pas seulement. Parfait pour les voyages d\u2019affaires ou de loisirs, nos espaces de r\u00e9union flexibles s'adaptent \u00e0 tous les \u00e9v\u00e9nements. Au Hilton Brussels Grand Place, un s\u00e9jour m\u00e9morable et confortable vous attend.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":"https:\/\/visitpandox.com\/hilton-brussels-grand-place\/","visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Hilton Brussels Grand Place","address_street_name":"Carrefour de l'Europe ","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"brusselsgrandplace_events@hilton.com","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselsgrandplace.hilton.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 42 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 42 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Carrefour de l'Europe , 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description