Nh","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002595"},"en":{"name":"Halloween before Night Tour","shortdescr":"Hop on the \"Halloween Before Night\" bustour and dive into the spooky Halloween atmosphere. Young and old will discover the mysteries of Brussels through eerie stories, told in English and French by a costumed guide. Sweets will be handed out throughout the ride. Get on board for a unique and unforgettable experience!","longdescr":"Let yourself be enchanted by the twilight magic of Brussels as you board our 100% electric panoramic bus for a captivating one-hour adventure. You will journey through the city\u2019s most iconic neighborhoods, where every street corner hides a mystery, a story waiting to be told.\n\nThis nonstop tour will immerse you in the heart of the Halloween spirit, with a costumed guide, speaking both French and English, ready to thrill you with tales that are as eerie as they are intriguing. As you travel through the enchanting streets, sweet treats will be offered throughout the ride, delighting the taste buds of both young and old.\n\nSo, step aboard this unique experience and let yourself be swept away on a magical adventure! \nBook now through our website and enjoy a special Halloween discount on your tickets: https:\/\/bit.ly\/489mUNh. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/dashboard.ventrata.com\/checkout\/en?checkout=c2e713a5-6da1-44fc-bd2d-f3f3f88fdf8a&r=af.brussels","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002595"},"it":{"name":"Halloween before Night Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/489mUNh","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002595"},"cn":{"name":"Halloween before Night Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/489mUNh","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002595"},"fr":{"name":"Tour Halloween avant la nuit","shortdescr":"Embarquez pour le tour en bus \"Halloween Avant la Nuit\" et plongez dans l\u2019atmosph\u00e8re d\u2019Halloween. Petits et grands d\u00e9couvriront les myst\u00e8res de Bruxelles \u00e0 travers des histoires effrayantes, racont\u00e9es en anglais et en fran\u00e7ais par un guide d\u00e9guis\u00e9 pour l'occasion. Des friandises seront distribu\u00e9es tout au long du trajet. Montez \u00e0 bord pour une exp\u00e9rience unique et inoubliable !","longdescr":"Laissez-vous envo\u00fbter par la magie cr\u00e9pusculaire de Bruxelles en montant \u00e0 bord de notre bus panoramique 100% \u00e9lectrique, pour une aventure fascinante d\u2019environ une heure. Vous traverserez ses quartiers embl\u00e9matiques, o\u00f9 chaque coin de rue cache un myst\u00e8re, une histoire. \n\nCe voyage sans escale vous transportera au c\u0153ur de l'esprit d'Halloween, avec un guide d\u00e9guis\u00e9 qui saura, en fran\u00e7ais et en anglais, vous captiver avec des r\u00e9cits tant\u00f4t effrayants, tant\u00f4t intrigants. Tout au long du trajet, des friandises seront distribu\u00e9es pour satisfaire les petits et grands gourmands.\n\nAlors, montez \u00e0 bord de cette exp\u00e9rience unique, et laissez-vous emporter dans cette aventure !\nR\u00e9servez d\u00e8s maintenant via notre site et profitez d\u2019un discount sp\u00e9cial Halloween sur vos billets : https:\/\/bit.ly\/489mUNh. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/489mUNh","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002595"},"sp":{"name":"Halloween before Night Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/489mUNh","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002595"},"nl":{"name":"Halloween voor nacht Tour","shortdescr":"Stap aan boord van de \"Halloween Voor de Nacht\" bustour en dompel je onder in de Halloween-sfeer. Jong en oud ontdekken de mysteries van Brussel via griezelige verhalen, verteld in het Engels en Frans door een verklede gids. Tijdens de rit worden er snoepjes uitgedeeld. Kom aan boord voor een unieke en onvergetelijke ervaring!","longdescr":"Laat je betoveren door de schemermagie van Brussel terwijl je aan boord stapt van onze 100% elektrische panoramabus van Tootbus voor een boeiende tocht van ongeveer een uur. Je reist door de meest iconische wijken van de stad, waar elke straathoek een mysterie of een verhaal verbergt.\n\nDeze non-stop rit dompelt je onder in de Halloweensfeer, met een verklede gids die zowel in het Frans als Engels spannende verhalen vertelt, soms eng, soms intrigerend. Tijdens de rit worden snoepjes uitgedeeld om jong en oud te verwennen.\n\nStap dus aan boord van deze unieke ervaring en laat je meevoeren op een magisch avontuur! Boek nu via onze website en profiteer van een speciale Halloweenkorting op je tickets: https:\/\/bit.ly\/489mUNh. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/dashboard.ventrata.com\/checkout\/en?checkout=c2e713a5-6da1-44fc-bd2d-f3f3f88fdf8a&r=af.brussels","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002595"}},"place":{"id":279901,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+33 1 42 66 56 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+33 1 42 66 56 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Keizerinlaan","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+33 1 42 66 56 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Keizerinlaan, 54","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Jump aboard the Tootbus and discover Brussels' sights and sounds. With 18 stops, this 100% electric bus invites you to explore the city as you please. Hop on, hop off and indulge in a gourmet experience, a cultural stop or a stroll to discover a neighbourhood. Climb aboard our double-decker buses and enjoy a breathtaking view of the capital's gems: the majestic Cathedral of Saint Michael and Saint Gudula, the vast royal estate of Laeken, the imposing Basilica of the Sacred Heart in Koekelberg, the charming Sablons district\u2026 Along the way, let our audio guides tell you the stories of these emblematic sites in one of 11 languages available. To accompany you on your exploration, the free Tootbus app even offers commented routes. Make the most of the capital at a reduced price with the Brussels Card. The Hop-on Hop-off option grants you unlimited access to our buses for 24, 48 or 72 hours. Try the Tootbus experience all over Brussels !","description_print":null,"booking_url":"http:\/\/ticket.visit.brussels\/nl\/279901\/tootbus-brussels\/shop","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+33 1 42 66 56 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+33 1 42 66 56 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Tootbus Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+33 1 42 66 56 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Embarquez \u00e0 bord du Tootbus et partez \u00e0 la rencontre des merveilles de Bruxelles. \u00c0 travers ses 18 arr\u00eats, ce bus 100 % \u00e9lectrique vous invite \u00e0 explorer la ville au fil de vos envies. Montez, descendez et laissez-vous tenter par un instant gourmand, une halte culturelle ou une balade \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte d\u2019un quartier. Prenez de la hauteur dans les bus \u00e0 imp\u00e9riale et appr\u00e9ciez la vue imprenable sur les joyaux de la capitale : la majestueuse cath\u00e9drale Saints-Michel-et-Gudule, le vaste domaine royal de Laeken, l\u2019imposante basilique du Sacr\u00e9-c\u0153ur de Koekelberg, le charmant quartier des Sablons\u2026 En chemin, les audioguides murmureront \u00e0 vos oreilles les histoires de ces lieux embl\u00e9matiques dans l\u2019une des 11 langues disponibles. Pour vous accompagner dans votre exploration, l\u2019application gratuite Tootbus vous propose m\u00eame des parcours comment\u00e9s. Profitez au maximum de la capitale \u00e0 prix r\u00e9duit en optant pour la Brussels Card. L\u2019option Hop-on Hop-off vous offre un acc\u00e8s illimit\u00e9 aux bus pendant 24, 48 ou 72\u202fh. Tentez l\u2019exp\u00e9rience Tootbus aux quatre coins de Bruxelles !","description_print":null,"booking_url":"http:\/\/ticket.visit.brussels\/fr\/279901\/tootbus-brussels\/shop","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+33 1 42 66 56 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Tootbus Brussel","address_street_name":"Keizerinlaan","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+33 1 42 66 56 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Keizerinlaan, 54","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Neem de Tootbus en ontdek hoe mooi Brussel wel niet is. Stap op en stap af aan 18 haltes. Tootbus is 100% elektrisch en laat je de stad verkennen zoals jij dat wilt. Ga voor een gastronomische ervaring, kies voor cultuur of maak een leuke wijkwandeling. In de dubbeldekkerbussen heb je een adembenemend uitzicht op de mooiste plekken van de hoofdstad: de majestueuze Kathedraal van Sint-Michiel en Sint-Goedele, het uitgestrekte Koninklijke Domein van Laken, de imposante Basiliek van het Heilig Hart in Koekelberg, de charmante Zavelwijk, ...  Onderweg vertellen de audiogidsen je alles over die iconische plekken. Je hebt de keuze uit maar liefst 11 talen. Maak ook gebruik van de gratis Tootbus-app. Daar vind je nog meer becommentarieerde routes. Kies zeker ook voor een Brussels Card. Dan kan je nog voordeliger genieten van Brussel. De Hop-on Hop-off-optie geeft je onbeperkt toegang tot bussen voor 24, 48 of 72 uur. Beleef de hoofdstad met de Tootbus, overal in Brussel !","description_print":null,"booking_url":"http:\/\/ticket.visit.brussels\/en\/279901\/tootbus-brussels\/shop","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[13],"translations":{"de":["Historisches Stadtzentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Historical Centre"],"it":["Centro storico"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre historique"],"sp":["Centro hist\u00f3rico"],"nl":["Historisch centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":39901,"location":{"lat":50.8473272,"lon":4.356787},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-07-11T12:41:29+02:00","published_at":"2023-02-02T14:41:22+01:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":279843,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Keizerinlaan","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Keizerinlaan, 54","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Tired of walking around the city and having to plan your trips to make the most of your stay in Brussels? With TOOTbus you can sit back, relax and they\u2019ll take care of the rest. This electric bus travels through the streets of the capital along two different routes, taking in historic buildings and new, designer constructions; symbols of the city and popular neighbourhoods; and all the capital's must-see attractions. The two routes offer a total of 26 stops, where you can hop on and off as you please. On board, audio explanations are available in numerous languages, and there's even a children's version, so everyone can enjoy the experience. Good to know: free walking tours are available on the TOOTbus app. \n\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=TOOTBUS&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=AF1AE33F-70EC-B13E-FB4B-CB1CA5286F4E&lg=EN","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"TOOTbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Vous avez la flemme de marcher, ou de planifier vos trajets pour optimiser votre s\u00e9jour \u00e0 Bruxelles ? TOOTbus vous propose de vous asseoir, de vous d\u00e9tendre \u2026 et de s\u2019occuper du reste. \u00c0 travers deux trajets, ce bus \u00e9lectrique sillonne les rues de la capitale, glissant entre b\u00e2tisses historiques et nouvelles constructions design, symboles de la ville et quartiers populaires ; \u00e9grainant, au fil des arr\u00eats, les must see de la capitale. Les deux lignes proposent, tout au long des parcours, un total de 16 arr\u00eats, o\u00f9 vous pouvez monter et descendre comme bon vous semble. A bord, les explications audios sont disponibles dans de nombreuses langues, et connaissent m\u00eame une version kids pour ne d\u00e9laisser personne. Bon \u00e0 savoir : des tours \u00e0 pied gratuits sont propos\u00e9s dans l\u2019app TOOTbus!","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=TOOTBUS&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=AF1AE33F-70EC-B13E-FB4B-CB1CA5286F4E&lg=FR","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de l'Imp\u00e9ratrice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Tootbus Brussels","address_street_name":"Keizerinlaan","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tootbus.com\/fr\/brussels\/accueil","phone_contact":"+32 490 43 16 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Keizerinlaan, 54","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ben je het wandelen beu, of heb je geen zin om je bezoek aan Brussel uit te stippelen? TOOTbus doet het werk 