 la clef sous les critiques d'un jury qualifi\u00e9 ! Vendredi 11 Octobre : tirage au sort des genres (Kick off) 17:00 \u00e0 Bruxelles (TBA) Apr\u00e8s le lancement du concours vous aurez 48h chrono pour r\u00e9aliser votre court m\u00e9trage! Deadline et remise des projets dimanche 13 octobre \u00e0 19:30. Weekend du 26 - 27 Octobre : s\u00e9ances de projection au Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Riches-Claires (Rue des Riches-Claires 24, 1000 Bruxelles) Jury: TBA Prix: TBA INSCRIPTIONS : Pour enregistrer ton \u00e9quipe, rends toi sur le site des 48h Films Project : https:\/\/48hourfilm.com\/team-registration Pour plus d'informations, rends toi sur le site du 48h film project : https:\/\/www.48hourfilm.com Ou Instagram @48hourfilmproject.bxl - @entraks.bxl","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lesrichesclaires.be\/saison\/48hour-film-project\/","email":"diffusion@lesrichesclaires.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 25 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 25 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001411"},"sp":{"name":"48h Film Project","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lesrichesclaires.be\/saison\/48hour-film-project\/","email":"diffusion@lesrichesclaires.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 25 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 25 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001411"},"nl":{"name":"48h Film Project","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lesrichesclaires.be\/saison\/48hour-film-project\/","email":"diffusion@lesrichesclaires.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 25 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 25 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001411"}},"place":{"id":1085,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Les Riches-Claires","address_street_name":"Rue des Riches Claires","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"a