rdering the Impasses Schuddeveld and Sainte-P\u00e9tronille, you will find one of the favourite places of Brussels citizens: Le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone.\r\nTheater Toone is simultaneously a typical estaminet with its Spanish pink brick walls, blackened beams and tiled floor, a puppet theatre in the attic, with its wooden benches, festooned, multicoloured cushions nailed into the raw wood planks and a puppet museum. There, we find the characters who retired from the stage, these Toone heroes of the past and fetish characters of fellow puppeteers from around the world.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone: un th\u00e9\u00e2tre original et authentique, impr\u00e9gn\u00e9 d\u2019histoire et de culture bruxelloise !\r\nId\u00e9alement situ\u00e9 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la Grand-Place, dans une maison v\u00e9n\u00e9rable datant de 1696, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone poursuit la tradition s\u00e9culaire du th\u00e9\u00e2tre populaire de marionnettes depuis 1830. \r\nLa programmation est bas\u00e9e sur les grands classiques du th\u00e9\u00e2tre tels que \u00ab Les Trois Mousquetaires \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s Alexandre Dumas ou encore \u00ab Rom\u00e9o et Juliette \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s William Shakespeare.\r\nActuellement, le mus\u00e9e permanent de Toone situ\u00e9 au premier \u00e9tage du b\u00e2timent principal se visite gratuitement pendant l\u2019entracte.\r\nL\u2019estaminet folklorique au rez-de-chauss\u00e9e est ouvert tous les jours de 12h00 \u00e0 24h00, sauf le lundi (jour de fermeture).\r\nC\u2019est  un estaminet tricentenaire o\u00f9, dans une ambiance authentique de briques roses espagnoles, poutres noircies et sol dall\u00e9, vous pourrez appr\u00e9cier quelques bi\u00e8res, dont la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre gueuze. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Teatro Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Poppentheater Toone","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Traditioneel marionettentheater Brusselse folklore - Typisch Staminee.\r\nMuseum van Toone: Gratis toegang voor het publiek tijdens de pauze.\r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone in Brussel is een origineel en authentiek poppentheater dat doorspekt is van Brusselse geschiedenis en cultuur! \r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone zet sinds 1830 de eeuwenoude traditie van het volkse Theater voort.\r\nDe programmatie is gebaseerd op grote toneelklassiekers zoals \"Cyrano de Bergerac\" van Edmond Rostand, \"De Drie Musketiers\" van Alexandre Dumas, \"Romeo en Julia\" van William Shakespeare en \"Tijl Uilenspiegel\" van Charles De Coster. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":913,"location":{"lat":50.8471135,"lon":4.3536487},"last_updated_at":"2023-10-24T15:31:21+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:54+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"video","link":"https:\/\/youtu.be\/yRtpwBdLImk?feature=shared","width":null,"height":null,"ratio":null,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Dracula","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Dracula","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Dracula","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Dracula","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Dracula","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"Dracula","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Dracula","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Dracula","copyright":null}}},{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/be29fcf628523c1992dc536f72244ad38db7a3ce.jpg","width":2309,"height":1535,"ratio":1.5,"oEmbed_height":1535,"oEmbed_width":2309,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Dracula & Woltje","copyright":null},"pt":{"t