efined the last forty years. \u00bb \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Baronian ","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Baronian Xippas","address_street_name":"Rue Isidore Verheyden","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@baronian.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.baronian.eu","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 92 95","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Isidore Verheyden, 2","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Baronian Xippas","address_street_name":"Rue Isidore Verheyden","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@baronian.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.baronian.eu","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 92 95","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Isidore Verheyden, 2","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Baronian","address_street_name":"Rue Isidore Verheyden","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@baronian.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.baronian.eu","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 92 95","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Isidore Verheyden, 2","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Albert Baronian est l\u2019un des galeristes les plus embl\u00e9matiques de la capitale. Il a d\u00e9but\u00e9 ses activit\u00e9s dans les ann\u00e9es 70. La programmation de sa galerie refl\u00e8te ses gouts \u00e9clectiques et sensibles. Les artistes du mouvement de l\u2019arte povera comme Alighiero e Boetti ou Mario Merz y trouvent une vitrine belge pour valoriser leur travail. Gilbert & Georges, Tony Oursler, Bruno Serralongue, Robert Devriendt\u2026 Le programme de la g