23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibitions","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[36],"translations":{"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null],"en":["Museums and art centers"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Dessins anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fineartsmuseum.recreatex.be\/Exhibitions\/Overview?ExpositionType=1C6AFDDE-9739-E811-80CF-5820B1E20448","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000461"},"pt":{"name":"Dessins anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fineartsmuseum.recreatex.be\/Exhibitions\/Overview?ExpositionType=1C6AFDDE-9739-E811-80CF-5820B1E20448","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000461"},"en":{"name":"Old drawings : From Bruegel to Rubens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"93 old drawings, from Bruegel to Rubens, will grace the Old Masters collection from 11 October.\n\nTwo centuries of drawing art come to life in this surprising selection of almost a hundred works.\n\nThere is a formidable range of drawing styles: from the meticulously finished style of PIETER BRUEGEL to the swirling one of RUBENS. Inventive scenes from mythology and the Bible, skilfully constructed landscapes and spontaneous studies of life in the 16th and 17th centuries complete this astonishingly varied museumcollection.\n\nCatalogue available, on sale in the shop\nIncluded with ticket Old Masters","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fineartsmuseum.recreatex.be\/Exhibitions\/Overview?ExpositionType=1C6AFDDE-9739-E811-80CF-5820B1E20448","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000461"},"it":{"name":"Dessins anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fineartsmuseum.recreatex.be\/Exhibitions\/Overview?ExpositionType=1C6AFDDE-9739-E811-80CF-5820B1E20448","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000461"},"cn":{"name":"Dessins anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fineartsmuseum.recreatex.be\/Exhibitions\/Overview?ExpositionType=1C6AFDDE-9739-E811-80CF-5820B1E20448","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000461"},"fr":{"name":"Dessins anciens : From Bruegel to Rubens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"93 dessins anciens, de Bruegel \u00e0 Rubens, agr\u00e9menteront la collection Old Masters d\u00e8s le 11 octobre.\n\nDeux si\u00e8cles de l\u2019art du dessin prennent vie dans cette surprenante s\u00e9lection de pr\u00e8s d\u2019une centaine d\u2019\u0153uvres. Du plus m\u00e9ticuleusement fini de Pieter Bruegel au style tourbillonnant de Rubens. Des sc\u00e8nes inventives tir\u00e9es de la mythologie et de la Bible, des paysages habilement construits et des \u00e9tudes spontan\u00e9es de la vie aux XVIe et XVIIe si\u00e8cles compl\u00e8tent cet ensemble d'une \u00e9tonnante vari\u00e9t\u00e9.\n\n\u00c0 d\u00e9couvrir avec votre ticket \u201cOld masters\u201d\nCatalogue disponible, en vente au shop","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fineartsmuseum.recreatex.be\/Exhibitions\/Overview?ExpositionType=1C6AFDDE-9739-E811-80CF-5820B1E20448","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000461"},"sp":{"name":"Dessins anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fineartsmuseum.recreatex.be\/Exhibitions\/Overview?ExpositionType=1C6AFDDE-9739-E811-80CF-5820B1E20448","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000461"},"nl":{"name":"Oude tekeningen: From Bruegel to Rubens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"93 oude tekeningen, van Bruegel tot Rubens, zullen vanaf 11 oktober de collectie Old Masters sieren.\n\nTwee eeuw tekenkunst komt tot leven in deze verrassende selectie van bijna honderd werken. Er is een formidabele waaier aan tekenstijlen: van de minutieuze stijl van Pieter Bruegel tot de wervelende van Rubens. Inventieve taferelen uit de mythologie en de Bijbel, vakkundig geconstrueerde landschappen en spontane studies van het leven in de 16de en 17de eeuw vervolledigen de verbazingwekkend gevarieerde museumcollectie.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fineartsmuseum.recreatex.be\/Exhibitions\/Overview?ExpositionType=1C6AFDDE-9739-E811-80CF-5820B1E20448","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000461"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":n