Nouveau \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Au 19\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, la r\u00e9putation de la Belgique faisait de Bruxelles un point de rencontre fastueux. \u00c0 la pointe de l'industrie m\u00e9tallurgique, premier producteur de voitures, sollicit\u00e9 de partout pour la construction ferroviaire, le pays attirait les grands de ce monde. \u00c0 l'invitation d\u2019Ernest Solvay -l'un de nos brillants capitaines d'industrie-, les prix Nobel (dont Einstein) se r\u00e9unissaient, par exemple, \u00e0 l'h\u00f4tel M\u00e9tropole. Le meilleur exemple de ce dynamisme est la naissance de l'Art Nouveau gr\u00e2ce au g\u00e9nial architecte Victor Horta.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008870"},"sp":{"name":"Art Nouveau \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008870"},"nl":{"name":"Art Nouveau \u00e0 Ixelles et Saint-Gilles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008870"}},"place":{"id":270168,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine 25","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine 25","address_l