er and chocolate, another Bruges, Simenon and Maigret, Fashion workshops, design, Brussels is there for you, the Gay Brussels, \u201cWho killed Sir the Count?\u201d, Sustainable Brussels.\r\n\r\nIn Brussels and all Belgium. Our programs are exclusive and interactive.\r\nOur team: \r\n\u2022  2 specialists who ensure that your program meets your objectives and exceeds your clients expectations. \r\n\u2022  100 multilingual guides, entertainers, coordinators, hotesses, ... specialists in Belgium\u2019s off  the beaten path treasures. \r\n\u2022  We answer 7 days a week \r\n\u2022 Our aim: to live art as an \u201cArt de Vivre\u201d ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Professionnels dans l'organisation d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nements culturels depuis 1986.\r\nVous \u00eates \u00e0 la recherche d'un team-building cr\u00e9atif et culturel pour vos collaborateurs? Ou d'un programme social pour vos clients? Contactez-nous et d\u00e9couvrez nos propositions:\r\n- Rallyes inoubliables: New: \"Enigme sanglant, mais qui a tu\u00e9 monsieur le Comte?\" devenez un detective et trouvez la solution: \u00e0 pied, en tuk tuk, dans une old timer...\r\n- Chateaux et lieux exclusifs pour vos \u00e9v\u00e9nements d\u2019atmosph\u00e8re et tour VIP\r\n- Diner Thematique: Ex: Art Nouveau, possibilit\u00e9 de l'agr\u00e9menter avec: guides costum\u00e9s, musique live, interpr\u00e8te de Jacques Brel, magiciens, danseurs, acteurs,...\r\n- Itin\u00e9raires sur mesure: Art Nouveau, Anvers \u00e0 la mode, hommage \u00e0 Brel, Brussels by night, Bi\u00e8re et Chocolat, Bruxelles insolite, Simenon et Maigret, Atelier mode, design, Le Gay Bruxelles, \"Qui a tu\u00e9...\", Bruxelles durable.\r\n\r\nSur Bruxelles et toute la Belgique. Nous r\u00e9pondons sur mesure et \u00e0 la demande.\r\nNotre Equipe:\r\n- 4 professionnels pour s'assurer que votre programme atteigne vos objectifs et d\u00e9passe les attentes de vos clients.\r\n- 200 guides multilingues, acteurs, coordinateurs, hotesses,... sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s dans la mise \u00e0 l'honneur de la Belgique et ses tr\u00e9sors cach\u00e9s.\r\n- 7 jours sur 7\r\n- Notre objectif: vivre l'Art comme un Art de Vivre.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address