lumineux et moderne, le chef ex\u00e9cutif Gabriele Petrucci vous surprendra avec ses plats classiques belges r\u00e9imagin\u00e9s avec une belle touche.\n\nD\u00e9couvrez notre nouveau bar terrasse-rooftop au 7\u00e8me \u00e9tage avec une vue imprenable sur la place Jourdan. Il peut \u00eatre privatis\u00e9 jusqu'\u00e0 65 personnes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Sofitel Brussels Europe","address_street_name":"Place Jourdan","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"H5282-SB@sofitel.com","website":"https:\/\/www.sofitel-brussels-europe.com\/en\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 235 51 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Place Jourdan, 1","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Sofitel Brussels Europe","address_street_name":"Jourdanplein","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"H5282-SB@sofitel.com","website":"https:\/\/www.sofitel-brussels-europe.com\/en\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 235 51 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Jourdanplein, 1","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":"Ontdek de metamorfose van het hotel na de renovatie van het rooftop, de vergaderzalen, de lobby, de bar en het restaurant.\n\nOns 5*-hotel is ideaal gelegen aan het levendige Jourdanplein in het hart van het EU-district, omringd door het Leopoldpark.\n\nHet hotel beschikt over 147 eigentijdse en stijlvolle kamers en 12 onlangs gerenoveerde vergaderzalen met daglicht en een capaciteit tot 225 personen.\n\nDe vergaderzalen liggen allemaal op dezelfde verdieping rond het lichte atrium.\n\nIn de lobby van het hotel vindt u onze eigen Neuhaus boetiek, waar u de beste Belgische chocolade kunt kopen.\n\nOp zoek naar een geweldig Belgisch restaurant? Bij \"THE 1040\" bent u aan het juiste adres! In een helder en modern decor zal Executive Chef Gabriele Petrucci je verrassen met hun heruitgevonden Belgische klassieke gerechten met een mooie twist.\n\nOntdek onze nieuwe bar op het Rooftop terras op de 7e verdieping met een prachtig uitzicht op het Jourdan plein. Het kan worden geprivatiseerd tot 65 personen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["European Quarter"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"nl":["Europese wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":22770,"location":{"lat":50.836847,"lon":4.3814799},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-07-08T09:05:45+02:00","published_at":"2015-10-20T15:18:41+02:00","import_origin":"efficy","external_id":22469,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":50001075,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Brussels By Foot","address_street_name":"\u00c0 la jonction entre la Galerie de la Reine et la Galerie du Roi (devant le restaurant \u00ab Le Marmiton \u00bb)","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselsbyfoot.com","website":"https:\/\/brusselsbyfoot.be\/sur-les-traces-de-karl-marx\/","phone_contact":"+32 472 39 82 17","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"\u00c0 la jonction entre la Galerie de la Reine et la Galerie du Roi (devant le restaurant \u00ab Le Marmiton \u00bb)","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Brussels By Foot is a small company offering unusual guided tours of Brussels. They create themed tours to help you discover Brussels from very special, sometimes surprising angles... All passionate Brusseleirs, they take you through the streets and alleys of Brussels and show you the city as they know it, as they love it.\n\nUrban legends, social struggles, crime scenes, Art Nouveau, or other themes, join us and discover Brussels as you've never seen it before!\n\nThe tours are available on registration via the website, but private tours for groups can also be arranged on request. In these private experiences, why not combine the tour with a chocolate tasting, a brusseleir aperitif, or a meal in an authentic Brussels establishment?","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Brussels By Foot","address_street_name":"\u00c0 la jonction entre la Galerie de la Reine et la Galerie du Roi (devant le restaurant \u00ab Le Marmiton \u00bb)","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselsbyfoot.com","website":"https:\/\/brusselsbyfoot.be\/sur-les-traces-de-karl-marx\/","phone_contact":"+32 472 39 82 17","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"\u00c0 la jonction entre la Galerie de la Reine et la Galerie du Roi (devant le restaurant \u00ab Le Marmiton \u00bb)","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Brussels By Foot is a small company offering unusual guided tours of Brussels. They create themed tours to help you discover Brussels from very special, sometimes surprising angles... All passionate Brusseleirs, they take you through the streets and alleys of Brussels and show you the city as they know it, as they love it.\n\nUrban legends, social struggles, crime scenes, Art Nouveau, or other themes, join us and discover Brussels as you've never seen it before!\n\nThe tours are available on registration via the website, but private tours for groups can also be arranged on request. In these private experiences, why not combine the tour with a chocolate tasting, a brus