"Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"nl":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Tamala - Sortie d'album \"Diboli\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20241030_tamala_diboli\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001074"},"pt":{"name":"Tamala - Sortie d'album \"Diboli\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20241030_tamala_diboli\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001074"},"en":{"name":"Tamala - Sortie d'album \"Diboli\"","shortdescr":"The group Tamala, whose name means \u201ctravelers,\u201d embodies the spirit of exploration, delving into the endless possibilities of blending the kora, violin, and voice.","longdescr":"After years of touring and performing on numerous stages around the world, Tamala is now releasing their third album \u2018Diboli\u201c. This quartet delves into universal themes such as love, our connection to nature, and the search for identity. The time has come for Lumba, which means \u201cthe big day\u201d in Mandinka. In this new release, the group takes a broader view of the world, daring to dream of a fresh start while calling out humanity\u2019s missteps to better highlight our brighter sides.\n\nMusically, Tamala showcases their versatility in this album. Of course, there is the powerful voice of Mola Sylla, who not only keeps you captivated until the very last note but also surprises with an impressive range of self-made instruments. Kora virtuoso Bao Sissoko stands out as a gifted soloist with a keen sense of rhythm, as well as a talented composer. On the violin, the highly versatile Wouter Vandenabeele brings a contemporary European touch, making Tamala more than just the sum of its parts. A fourth musician, Olivier Vander Bauwede, has recently joined the project, adding bluesy tones to Tamala\u2019s music with his harmonica.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20241030_tamala_diboli\/?lang=en","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001074"},"it":{"name":"Tamala - Sortie d'album \"Diboli\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20241030_tamala_diboli\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001074"},"cn":{"name":"Tamala - Sortie d'album \"Diboli\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20241030_tamala_diboli\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001074"},"fr":{"name":"Tamala - Sortie d'album \"Diboli\"","shortdescr":"Le groupe Tamala (\u00ab\u2009voyageurs\u2009\u00bb), \u00e0 l\u2019image de son nom, explore les infinies possibilit\u00e9s de la rencontre entre la kora, le violon et la voix","longdescr":"Apr\u00e8s plusieurs ann\u00e9es sur les routes \u00e0 jouer sur de nombreuses sc\u00e8nes et dans de nombreux pays, Tamala pr\u00e9sente son troisi\u00e8me album \u2018Diboli\u2019. Le quartet explore ici des th\u00e8mes aussi universels que l\u2019amour, la connexion \u00e0 la nature ou la qu\u00eate identitaire. \u00c7a y est, c\u2019est l\u2019heure de Lumba, \u00ab\u2009le grand jour\u2009\u00bb en mandingue. Le groupe prend de la hauteur sur le monde dans ce nouvel opus, et ose r\u00eaver \u00e0 un nouveau d\u00e9part, en d\u00e9non\u00e7ant les frasques de l\u2019humanit\u00e9 pour mieux mettre en valeur nos c\u00f4t\u00e9s lumineux.\n\nMusicalement, Tamala montre ici son c\u00f4t\u00e9 le plus polyvalent. Il y a bien s\u00fbr la voix puissante de Mola Sylla. Non seulement il vous fait haleter jusqu\u2019\u00e0 la toute derni\u00e8re note, mais il vous surprend \u00e9galement avec un \u00e9ventail \u00e9tonnant d\u2019instruments fabriqu\u00e9s lui-m\u00eame. Le virtuose de la kora Bao Sissoko se distingue non seulement en tant que soliste dou\u00e9 et sensible au groove, mais aussi en tant que compositeur. Au violon, le tr\u00e8s polyvalent Wouter Vandenabeele ajoute une touche europ\u00e9enne contemporaine, faisant de Tamala plus que la somme de ses parties. Un quatri\u00e8me musicien, Olivier Vander Bauwede, vient de rejoindre le projet et ajoute des sonorit\u00e9s blues \u00e0 la musique de Tamala avec l\u2019aide de son harmonica.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20241030_tamala_diboli\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001074"},"sp":{"name":"Tamala - Sortie d'album \"Diboli\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20241030_tamala_diboli\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001074"},"nl":{"name":"Tamala - Sortie d'album \"Diboli\"","shortdescr":"De groep Tamala, wat \u201creizigers\u201d betekent, doet zijn naam eer aan door de eindeloze mogelijkheden te verkennen van de samensmelting tussen kora, viool en zang.","longdescr":"Na jarenlange optredens op talloze podia in verschillende landen, komt Tamala nu met hun derde album \u2018Diboli\u2019. Het kwartet verkent hierin universele thema\u2019s als liefde, de verbinding met de natuur en de zoektocht naar identiteit. De tijd is aangebroken voor Lumba, Mandinka voor \u201cde grote dag.\u201d In dit nieuwe werk neemt de groep afstand van de wereld en droomt van een nieuw begin, terwijl ze de tekortkomingen van de mensheid aankaarten om onze lichte kanten beter te belichten.\n\nMuzikaal laat Tamala zich hier van zijn meest veelzijdige kant zien. De krachtige stem van Mola Sylla springt eruit: hij houdt je in spanning tot de laatste noot en verrast je bovendien met een indrukwekkende reeks zelfgemaakte instrumenten. Kora-virtuoos Bao Sissoko schittert niet alleen als getalenteerde solist met een fijn gevoel voor groove, maar ook als componist. Violist Wouter Vandenabeele voegt een eigentijdse Europese toets toe, waardoor Tamala meer wordt dan slechts de som van zijn delen. Nieuw in de groep is Olivier Vander Bauwede, die met zijn mondharmonica bluesklanken toevoegt aan de muziek van Tamala.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20241030_tamala_diboli\/?lang=nl","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001074"}},"place":{"id":241923,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Atelier 210","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e Saint-Pierre","address_street_number":"210","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier210.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier210.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 732 25 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e Saint-Pierre, 210","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Atelier 210","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e