/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"cn":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.monsterbasket.be","email":"mathieu@monsterbasket.be","phone_contact":"+32 472 48 62 17","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"fr":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":"Acad\u00e9mie de basket: initiation basket et psychomotricit\u00e9 pour enfants de 5 \u00e0 12 ans.  Les cours ont lieu les samedis matins dans le Hall Omnisport du CERIA \u00e0 Anderlecht.","longdescr":"L\u2019association Monster Basket a la volont\u00e9 d\u2019offrir aux jeunes, \u00e0 travers le basket, la possibilit\u00e9 de pratiquer un sport (hors comp\u00e9tition) et de faire partie d\u2019un groupe, d\u2019une mani\u00e8re diff\u00e9rente qu\u2019\u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9cole. Nous souhaitons leur offrir une exp\u00e9rience sportive dans un esprit collectif et familial.\nNous offrons aux jeunes un endroit s\u00e9curis\u00e9 et moderne afin d\u2019y pratiquer des exercices vari\u00e9s (fondamentaux, psychomotricit\u00e9, \u2026).","performers":"Ludovic Hazard (basketbalcoach jongeren), Edna Carole Gahamanyi Senga (kin\u00e9sith\u00e9rapeute), Mathieu Kasiers (beheerder)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.monsterbasket.be","email":"mathieu@monsterbasket.be","phone_contact":"+32 472 48 62 17","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"sp":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.monsterbasket.be","email":"mathieu@monsterbasket.be","phone_contact":"+32 472 48 62 17","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"nl":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":"Basketbal academie: initiatie basketbal en psychomotorische vaardigheden voor kinderen van