escr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/10\/20\/point-of-view-s","email":"reservatie@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013087"},"fr":{"name":"Point of view(s)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"En compagnie d\u2019un historien ou d\u2019une historienne de l\u2019art, d\u00e9couvrez l\u2019exposition Point of view(s).\n\nEn duos, en duels ou en trios, des \u0153uvres d\u2019artistes du 19e au 21e si\u00e8cle se confrontent, s\u2019\u00e9paulent, se compl\u00e8tent en des associations in\u00e9dites. Ces dialogues ou \u00ab trialogues \u00bb stimulent une participation active de celles et ceux qui les regardent.\n\nAffinit\u00e9s ou dissemblances, quel sera votre point de vue ? Point of view(s) rassemble des ic\u00f4nes de notre collection d\u2019art moderne et contemporain avec, entre autres, Josef Albers, Francis Bacon, Robert Barry, Anna Boch, Marcel Broodthaers, Christo, Lucio Fontana, Constant Permeke, Andres Serrano, Vincent van Gogh, Rik Wouters\u2026 ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/10\/20\/point-of-view-s","email":"reservatie@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013087"},"sp":{"name":"Point of view(s)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/10\/20\/point-of-view-s","email":"reservatie@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013087"},"nl":{"name":"Point of view(s)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Ontdek samen met een kunsthistorica of kunsthistoricus de tentoonstelling Point of view(s).\n\nIn duo's, duels of trio's worden werken van kunstenaars uit de 19de tot de 21ste eeuw tegenover elkaar geplaatst. Ze versterken elkaar, vullen elkaar aan of leiden tot verrassende inzichten. Deze dialogen of \"trialogen\" stimuleren een actieve participatie van de toeschouwer.\n\nGelijkenissen of verschillen, wat zal jouw Point of view(s) zijn? Point of view(s) verzamelt iconen uit onze collectie moderne en hedendaagse kunst met onder anderen Josef Albers, Francis Bacon, Robert Barry, Anna Boch, Marcel Broodthaers, Christo, Lucio Fontana, Constant Permeke, Andres Serrano, Vincent van Gogh, Rik Wouters...","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/nl\/agenda\/2024\/10\/20\/point-of-view-s","email":"reservatie@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013087"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble six different museums: the Oldmasters Museum, Modern Museum, Meunier Museum, Wiertz Museum, Magritte Museum and the Fi