/l-amour-sous-algorithme","email":"reservations@tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001772"},"it":{"name":"L'amour sous algorithme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/theatre\/l-amour-sous-algorithme","email":"reservations@tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001772"},"cn":{"name":"L'amour sous algorithme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/theatre\/l-amour-sous-algorithme","email":"reservations@tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001772"},"fr":{"name":"L'amour sous algorithme","shortdescr":"\u201cL\u2019amour est une jungle. Tu es la reine de la jungle\u201d\nEn enqu\u00eatant sur l\u2019univers des applications de rencontre, une journaliste, elle-m\u00eame \u00e0 la recherche du grand amour, d\u00e9couvre le fonctionnement opaque et patriarcal de ces applications.\n","longdescr":"\u201cL\u2019amour est une jungle. Tu es la reine de la jungle\u201d\n\nEn enqu\u00eatant sur l\u2019univers des applications de rencontre, une journaliste, elle-m\u00eame \u00e0 la recherche du grand amour, d\u00e9couvre le fonctionnement opaque et patriarcal de ces applications.\nS\u2019engage pour elle une course effr\u00e9n\u00e9e pour s\u2019orienter dans ce labyrinthe des Big Data.\nUne plong\u00e9e vertigineuse dans le monde secret des algorithmes, qui questionne nos relations amoureuses \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e8re du num\u00e9rique.\n\nD\u2019\u2019apr\u00e8s le r\u00e9cit de Judith Duportail\nInterpr\u00e9tation : Alexia Depicker\nMise en sc\u00e8ne : Xavier Campion\nAdaptation et dramaturgie : Claude Enuset\nCr\u00e9ation sonore et vid\u00e9o : S\u00e9bastien Fernandez\nCr\u00e9ation Lumi\u00e8res : Joseph Lavicoli\nAssistanat mise en sc\u00e8ne : Zo\u00e9 Pauwels\nR\u00e9gie : Colin Petit-Bain\nIllustration : Marie Campion\nDiffusion : MTP memap ASBL\nCaptation vid\u00e9o : L\u00e9one P. Estingoy\nMusique : Guillaume Istace\n\nAvec la participation de : Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Clou, Jimony Ekila, Laure Voglaire, Lucas Jacquemin, St\u00e9phanie Van Vyve\n\nMerci \u00e0 Georges Siatidis et In\u00e9s Sanchez Carrascosa","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/theatre\/l-amour-sous-algorithme","email":"reservations@tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001772"},"sp":{"name":"L'amour sous algorithme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/theatre\/l-amour-sous-algorithme","email":"reservations@tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001772"},"nl":{"name":"L'amour sous algorithme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/theatre\/l-amour-sous-algorithme","email":"reservations@tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001772"}},"place":{"id":252101,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Link factory","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is above all a civil, cultural, sustainable and innovative project. Their cultural programme featuring performances, shows, exhibitions and so on goes hand in hand with a \u201ccivil\u201d programme of debates, conferences, inter-generational workshops, philosophical caf\u00e9 etc ... The place can be rented for events and there are plenty of really great parties! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie est un projet culturel fond\u00e9 en 2010 par une poign\u00e9e de citoyen\u00b7nes et situ\u00e9 dans une ancienne usine restaur\u00e9e avec des mat\u00e9riaux \u00e9cologiques. La Tricoterie propose une programmation culturelle tr\u00e8s diversifi\u00e9e et centr\u00e9e sur la rencontre entre les diff\u00e9rents publics et le m\u00e9lange des activit\u00e9s culturelles.\r\n\r\nPassez la porte et d\u00e9couvrez :\r\n- Des spectacles de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de danse, de cirque...\r\n- Des concerts, des soir\u00e9es, des sc\u00e8nes ouvertes, des jam sessions, une chorale d'un soir...\r\n- Des ateliers z\u00e9ro d\u00e9chet, peinture, c\u00e9ramique, \u0153nologie, danse...\r\n- Des projections de films, conf\u00e9rences, d\u00e9bats...\r\n- Des couscous \"s\u00e9pharabes\", des soir\u00e9es jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9, des activit\u00e9s pour enfants...\r\n- Des march\u00e9s des cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7rices, des vide-dressings, des march\u00e9s de No\u00ebl durables...\r\n\r\nUn petit creux ? La Triciterie vous propose un brunch tous les dimanches et un concept \"live cooking\" tous les vendredis soirs. Tous les plats sont 100% artisanaux, et pr\u00e9par\u00e9s sur place par l'\u00e9quipe avec des ingr\u00e9dients bio, locaux et de saison.\r\n\r\nEnvie d'organiser votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement chez vous ? La Tricoterie met ses salles \u00e0 disposition pour tout type d'\u00e9v\u00e9nement priv\u00e9 ou professionnel et propose \u00e9galement un service traiteur, que ce soit dans ses murs ou \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur. Rendez-vous sur www.tricoterie.be pour en savoir plus !\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"de":["Saint-Gilles Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"it":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"sp":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":14176,"location":{"lat":50.83028735,"lon":4.33675871},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-05-15T13:04:23+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:47:56+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":252101,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","